          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact page for {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — confidential therapy, telehealth and local appointments in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#fbfdfc; --muted:#6b7280; --card:#ffffff; --accent:#2b6cb0; --accent-2:#6b46c1;\\n      --radius:12px; --maxw:980px; --pad:20px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%; margin:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff 0%, #fbfdff 100%); color:#0f172a}\\n    .container{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:36px auto; padding:0 20px}\\n    header{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px}\\n    .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px}\\n    .logo{width:56px; height:56px; background:var(--card); border-radius:10px; display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(16,24,40,0.06)}\\n    .logo svg{width:34px;height:34px}\\n    nav{display:flex; gap:18px; align-items:center; font-size:15px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted); text-decoration:none}\\n    nav a.current{color:#0f172a; font-weight:600}\\n\\n    .grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 420px; gap:28px; margin-top:28px}\\n    .panel{background:var(--card); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:22px; box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(15,23,42,0.05)}\\n\\n    h1{margin:0; font-size:22px; letter-spacing:-0.2px}\\n    p.lead{margin:10px 0 18px; color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    form label{display:block; font-size:13px; color:#111827; margin-bottom:6px}\\n    input[type=text], input[type=email], textarea, select{width:100%; padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #e6edf3; border-radius:10px; background:#fbfeff; font-size:14px; color:#0b1220}\\n    textarea{min-height:110px; resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:flex; gap:12px}\\n    .row .col{flex:1}\\n    .muted{font-size:13px; color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .meta{display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; margin-top:8px}\\n    .meta .pill{padding:8px 10px; background:#f1f5f9; border-radius:10px; font-size:13px; color:#0b1220}\\n\\n    .btn{display:inline-block; background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2)); color:white; padding:10px 16px; border-radius:10px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600}\\n    .subtle{background:transparent; border:1px solid #e6edf3; padding:8px 12px; border-radius:10px; color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .info-list{display:grid; gap:10px; margin-top:12px}\\n    .info-item{display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start}\\n    .info-item strong{display:block}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:28px; font-size:13px; color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* Responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.logo{width:48px;height:48px}.brand .title{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <!-- simple unique mark -->\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" aria-hidden>\\n            <rect x=\\\"6\\\" y=\\\"10\\\" width=\\\"52\\\" height=\\\"44\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#eaf6ff\\\" />\\n            <path d=\\\"M18 38c6-8 12-10 28-14\\\" stroke=\\\"#2b6cb0\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" />\\n            <circle cx=\\\"20\\\" cy=\\\"22\\\" r=\\\"2.4\\\" fill=\\\"#6b46c1\\\" />\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Main navigation\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Areas</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Approach</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">FAQ</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"subtle\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" class=\\\"current\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"grid\\\" role=\\\"main\\\">\\n      <section>\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n          <h1>Reach out for a thoughtful conversation</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I hold a quiet, attentive space for people navigating anxiety, relationship shifts, grief, burnout, and life transitions. Use this page to request an appointment or ask a question about my cohort programs, individual work, or how telehealth fits your needs.</p>\\n\\n          <form method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" aria-label=\\\"Contact form\\\">\\n            <input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"therapist\\\" value=\\\"{{THERAPIST_NAME}}\\\">\\n            <input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"license\\\" value=\\\"{{LICENSE}}\\\">\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your full name</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" required>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"col\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"col\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"(555) 555-5555\\\">\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"modality\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Preferred modality</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"modality\\\" name=\\\"modality\\\">\\n              <option value=\\\"telehealth\\\">Telehealth</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"in-person\\\">In-person ({{CITY}}, {{STATE}})</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"cohort\\\">Cohort program</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"reason\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Briefly, what brings you here?</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"reason\\\" name=\\\"reason\\\" placeholder=\\\"You can mention goals, concerns, availability or any questions about therapy.\\\" required></textarea>\\n\\n            <label style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"consent\\\" required> I understand this message may include personal information and I consent to be contacted by {{BUSINESS_NAME}} about services. I have read the privacy and crisis information below.</label>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:14px; align-items:center\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n              <a class=\\\"subtle\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule directly</a>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Prefer to call? <strong style=\\\"color:#0b1220\\\">{{PHONE}}</strong> • Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n          </form>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px; border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9; padding-top:14px\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; align-items:center\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-size:13px; color:var(--muted)\\\">Office</div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:600\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — Telehealth available</div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Sessions: Individual &amp; Cohort</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Modalities: {{MODALITIES}}</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n            <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px 0\\\">A gentle primer — what happens next?</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">After you submit this form I will review your message within 48 hours on weekdays. If you indicate urgency, I will prioritize a callback. If I am not a good fit I will offer referrals. You can also review core pages for details on scope and structure:</p>\\n            <ul style=\\\"margin:12px 0 0 18px; color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n              <li><a href=\\\"index.html#diagnostic\\\">Diagnostic overview</a> — how we assess priorities</li>\\n              <li><a href=\\\"index.html#plan\\\">Care plan</a> — collaborative goals and pace</li>\\n              <li><a href=\\\"index.html#micro_habits\\\">Micro practices</a> — small, daily supports</li>\\n              <li><a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Fees &amp; pricing</a> — cohort and individual options</li>\\n            </ul>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px 0\\\">Connect details</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Quick info for scheduling and administrative questions.</p>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"info-list\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"info-item\\\"><div style=\\\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:#eef7ff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#0b1220\\\">P</div><div><strong>Phone</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{PHONE}}</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"info-item\\\"><div style=\\\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:#f5f0ff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#3b2667\\\">E</div><div><strong>Email</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{EMAIL}}</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"info-item\\\"><div style=\\\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:#f1f5f9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#0b1220\\\">L</div><div><strong>License</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{LICENSE}} — {{THERAPIST_NAME}}</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"info-item\\\"><div style=\\\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff7ed;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#7a4300\\\">H</div><div><strong>Hours</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm (by appointment)</div></div></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px; font-size:13px; color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <strong>Session types</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Private individual sessions, skill-based cohort groups, and short-term intake consultations. Insurance varies — see <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Fees</a> for details.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Privacy &amp; limits of care</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Confidentiality is central to our work. Communications are treated as confidential except where disclosure is required by law (e.g., imminent risk of harm, suspected abuse) or when you provide written authorization for release. Electronic contact (email/forms) is not fully secure; use phone if you need greater privacy. See the full <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">privacy notes</a> on the FAQ page.</p>\\n\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:6px\\\">Crisis disclaimer</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">If you are in crisis or are an immediate danger to yourself or others, call emergency services or your local crisis line. I do not provide emergency services. If you indicate imminent risk in this form I will attempt to contact you, but please use emergency resources when needed.</p>\\n\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">Privacy</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"terms.html\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">Terms</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"This chunk contains the contact page and a short README for the private practice therapist site.\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html — Contact & intake form, practitioner contact details, confidentiality and crisis disclaimers, links to required site sections (diagnostic, plan, micro_habits, pricing) so the required section pack clearly ripples across pages.\\n\\nPlaceholders used (keep them in the global build or replace at deploy time):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{THERAPIST_NAME}}\\n- {{LICENSE}}\\n- {{MODALITIES}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- layoutFamily: clinic_modern (clean grid, calm palette, precise components).\\n- voiceFamily: spiritual_teacher — tone is reflective, grounding, professional.\\n- programModel: cohort referenced where relevant (session types include cohort programs).\\n\\nClinical & legal notes included on the page:\\n- Confidentiality & limits of care statement.\\n- Crisis disclaimer instructing to use emergency resources for imminent risk.\\n- Scope note about referrals if not a good fit.\\n\\nIntegration:\\n- The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. Adjust action to your server or form handler.\\n- Navigation links point to other pages in this project (index.html, about.html, specialties.html, approach.html, fees.html, faq.html, book.html). Ensure those files exist in the final build.\\n\\nAccessibility:\\n- Form inputs include labels and basic ARIA-friendly structure.\\n- Keep contact methods available for people who prefer phone over electronic messaging.\\n\\nIf you are assembling other chunks, ensure the assets (SVGs and shared styles) referenced across pages are provided in their respective chunks. This chunk intentionally avoids external fonts, scripts, or CDNs.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
